OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA murky
OL,6,Fnight with heavy spells of rain, and
OL,7,Ffog pushing inland. Breezy, with
OL,8,Fstrong winds along southern coasts.
OL,9,FFeeling much milder than Saturday
OL,10,Fnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FMurky with areas of patchy
OL,13,Frain, and fog possible along exposed
OL,14,Fcoasts. Some clear and breezy
OL,15,Finterludes, but feeling very mild with
OL,16,Ftemperatures perhaps reaching 20
OL,17,FCelsius in brighter breaks.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
