OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FHeavy
OL,6,Frain will pass on Tuesday morning to
OL,7,Fbecome bright, fresh and breezy.
OL,8,FBreezy again during Wednesday but dry
OL,9,Fwith sunny spells, then increasingly
OL,10,Fcloudy, wet and windy through Thursday.
